      "title": "Markdown 常用格式全量示例",
      "author": "lzwmt",
      "digest": "覆盖标题、强调、引用、代码、表格、任务列表、脚注、定义列表，以及复杂嵌套有序/无序列表。",
      "content": "<section style=\"background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e8e8e8; border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px 22px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;\"><h1 style=\"font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.35; color: #111827; margin: 8px 0 20px;\">Markdown 常用格式全量示例</h1><p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 18px;; margin-right: 12px;\">作者：lzwmt</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.7; margin: 0 0 18px;\">摘要：覆盖标题、强调、引用、代码、表格、任务列表、脚注、定义列表，以及复杂嵌套有序/无序列表。</p><p style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 16px 0;\">这是一段普通正文，里面包含 <strong>粗体</strong>、<em>斜体</em>、<del>删除线</del>、<code style=\"background: #f1f5f9; color: #0f172a; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.92em;\">inline code</code> 和 <a href=\"https://example.com\">示例链接</a>。</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1f2937; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">无序列表</h2>\n<ul style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 14px 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">一级项目 A</span><ul style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 14px 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">二级项目 A-1</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">二级项目 A-2</span><ul style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 14px 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">三级项目 A-2-a</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">一级项目 B</span><ul style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 14px 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">二级项目 B-1</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">一级项目 C</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1f2937; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">有序列表</h2>\n<ol style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 14px 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">第一步</span><ol style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 14px 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">第一步的子步骤 1</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">第一步的子步骤 2</span></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">第二步</span><ol style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 14px 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">第二步的子步骤 1</span><ol style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 14px 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">更深一级的步骤</span></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">第三步</span></li>\n</ol>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1f2937; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">混合列表</h2>\n<ol style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 14px 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">发布前检查</span><ul style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 14px 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">检查标题</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">检查摘要</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">检查封面</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">发布后检查</span><ul style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 14px 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">检查草稿内容</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">检查排版</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<ul style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 14px 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">反向混合父项</span><ol style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 14px 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">无序父项里的有序子项 1</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">无序父项里的有序子项 2</span></li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">另一个无序父项</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1f2937; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">引用</h2>\n<blockquote style=\"margin: 18px 0; padding: 12px 16px; background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; color: #334155;\">\n<p style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 16px 0;\">这是一级引用。</p>\n<ul style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 14px 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">引用里的列表项一</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">引用里的列表项二</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 16px 0;\"><code style=\"background: #f1f5f9; color: #0f172a; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.92em;\">引用里的行内代码</code></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1f2937; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">代码块</h2>\n<pre style=\"background: #0f172a; color: #e2e8f0; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 10px; overflow-x: auto; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 18px 0;\"><code class=\"language-python\">def greet(name: str) -&gt; str:\n    return f&quot;hello, {name}&quot;\n</code></pre>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1f2937; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">表格</h2>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 18px 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7;\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; background: #f8fafc; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left;\">字段</th>\n<th style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; background: #f8fafc; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left;\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; color: #374151;\">title</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; color: #374151;\">文章标题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; color: #374151;\">digest</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; color: #374151;\">文章摘要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; color: #374151;\">cover</td>\n<td style=\"border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; color: #374151;\">封面图片</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1f2937; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">任务列表</h2>\n<ul style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 14px 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"disabled\" checked=\"checked\" style=\"margin-right: 8px; transform: translateY(1px);\" /> <span>转换 HTML</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"disabled\" checked=\"checked\" style=\"margin-right: 8px; transform: translateY(1px);\" /> <span>检查列表结构</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><input type=\"checkbox\" disabled=\"disabled\" style=\"margin-right: 8px; transform: translateY(1px);\" /> <span>人工验收草稿</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1f2937; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">分隔线</h2>\n<hr style=\"border: none; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin: 28px 0;\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1f2937; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">图片</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 16px 0;\">示例图片链接：<a href=\"https://example.com/demo.png\">https://example.com/demo.png</a></p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1f2937; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">脚注</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 16px 0;\">这里有一个脚注说明（脚注内容：这是脚注内容，用于测试说明文本）。</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1f2937; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">定义列表</h2>\n<ul style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; padding-left: 1.4em; margin: 14px 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">草稿箱：微信公众号后台的草稿内容区域</span></li>\n<li style=\"margin: 6px 0;\"><span style=\"display: inline;\">封面图：发布文章时显示的题图</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.45; color: #1f2937; margin: 28px 0 14px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;\">内联 HTML</h2>\n<p style=\"color: #2f2f2f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 16px 0;\">说明：这里原本用于测试内联 HTML，为了兼容公众号草稿校验，当前改为普通文本说明。</p></section>",
